# {{.Project}}

An opinionated gin-kit framework application built on Gin.

## Development

```bash
go mod tidy
gin-kit run
```

The runtime lives in the versioned `github.com/Alfian57/gin-kit/framework`
dependency. Application routes, domains, services, and middleware belong in
this repository and can be customized without editing framework internals.

## Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env`, then configure the database and environment.
The application loads `.env` at startup through the framework's typed
configuration: real environment variables always win over `.env` values,
malformed values fail startup, and outside development `DATABASE_URL` and
`CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` are required. Timeouts use Go duration syntax (`10s`).

Generate secrets with `openssl rand -base64 48` (for example `JWT_SECRET`).
Run `gin-kit doctor` for actionable diagnostics.
